#
# Checksums of the migrations in this directory (migrations.md MG-5). One line
# per migration file: "<file>  <sha256 of the file>". `make db-sum` appends the
# lines of new files and never rewrites an existing line; `make db-check`
# rejects a changed, removed or unlisted migration. A published migration is
# never edited: a fix is a new migration.
